linos: You're back.
linos: Did you find them?
Player: I did.
Player: They weren't in danger.
Player: They had gathered near the beach.
linos: I suspected as much.
linos: Hydrogen are naturally attracted to unusual energy.
linos: It's good to know they're safe.
linos: You've done Atomonia a great service.
[signal arg="objective:quest_hydrogen_001:report_linos"]
linos: Actually...
linos: While you were away, another problem appeared...
linos: Some Iron Atomon have been scattering metal fragments around the eastern mine.
linos: Would you mind helping us again?
- Sure..
	linos: Ohhh..... Thank you traveler...
	[signal arg="quest_accept:quest_collect_iron"]
- Nah... I'm tired bruh.
	linos: Alright then, maybe next time...
	[end_timeline]